        <crgo:CRGO_0000286 xml:lang="en">NIST SP 800-53A Rev. 5 assessment objectives and methods (examine, interview, test), as carried in the SP 800-53 Rev. 5.2.0 OSCAL catalogue (2026-05-11)</crgo:CRGO_0000286>
