        <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">cible de la correspondance</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">mapping target</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Relates a mapping assertion to its target requirement, such as an obligation or a framework requirement.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="fr">Relie une assertion de correspondance à son exigence cible, comme une obligation ou une exigence de référentiel.</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">At most one value per subject; enforced by SHACL (Phase 4), not by an OWL functional axiom, to keep the module in OWL 2 EL.</skos:scopeNote>
