        <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">profil complet pour</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">profile complete for</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Names a property (by its CRGO key, such as offersServicesIn or transfersDataTo) for which the organisation profile lists every value, so that a value it does not list can be taken as absent. Without it, an unlisted value is unknown.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="fr">Nomme une propriété (par sa clé CRGO, comme offersServicesIn ou transfersDataTo) pour laquelle le profil de l&apos;organisation énumère toutes les valeurs, de sorte qu&apos;une valeur non énumérée peut être tenue pour absente. Sans cela, une valeur non énumérée est inconnue.</skos:definition>
        <crgo:CRGO_0000283 rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069"/>
        <crgo:CRGO_0000284 rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063"/>
        <crgo:CRGO_0000285 xml:lang="en">Independent review 2026-10-11: closed-world reading only where the profile declares it (ADR-004).</crgo:CRGO_0000285>
        <crgo:CRGO_0000286 xml:lang="en">CRGO v0.8 to v1.0 Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, 2026-10-11), sections 3-13</crgo:CRGO_0000286>
        <crgo:CRGO_0000288 rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181"/>
        <crgo:CRGO_0000289 rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182"/>
        <crgo:CRGO_0000290 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-11</crgo:CRGO_0000290>
        <crgo:CRGO_0000291>0.9.0</crgo:CRGO_0000291>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


